  destinations:
  - destinationName: Sand Dunes
    description: 'Towering dunes roll endlessly beneath the blazing desert sun.

      The
      shifting sands hide forgotten paths and ancient secrets.

      Every climb
      reveals breathtaking views across the golden horizon.

      Adventure awaits
      beyond every drifting dune.'
    background: {fileID: -5509395199181252754, guid: 07b7e6252accb47798c1937aafe2800c, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Oasis
    description: 'A sparkling oasis offers cool water in the heart of the desert.

      Palm
      trees provide welcome shade beneath the bright sky.

      Explore nearby trails
      to uncover hidden treasures.

      Hope blooms wherever fresh water flows.'
    background: {fileID: 249316095728038088, guid: 3024b77af08e0433d94efee1ae74ae52, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Canyon
    description: 'Massive canyon walls tower above winding desert pathways.

      Centuries
      of nature have carved incredible shapes into the rocks.

      Hidden passages
      reveal exciting new discoveries.

      Every turn leads deeper into adventure.'
    background: {fileID: 7799155169862758303, guid: 4119a222f4ae3480a91247187212b505, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Ancient Ruins
    description: 'Forgotten ruins stand silently beneath endless desert skies.

      Ancient
      stone walls guard mysteries waiting to be uncovered.

      Solve challenging
      puzzles to reveal long-lost secrets.

      History lives within every weathered
      stone.'
    background: {fileID: 6725698030895690777, guid: 3a4f57283e78241f0a79ce98e01e07a2, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Palm Valley
    description: 'Lush palm trees create a peaceful escape from the desert heat.

      Gentle
      streams bring life to the surrounding landscape.

      Explore hidden groves
      filled with sparkling surprises.

      Nature''s beauty thrives even in the
      harshest places.'
    background: {fileID: 3846404560210177461, guid: 31389a9941a094f40a75a80fc6db4dcc, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Sunset Desert
    description: 'The desert glows with warm orange and crimson colors as evening
      arrives.

      Long shadows stretch across endless rolling dunes.

      Discover
      hidden treasures before the sun disappears below the horizon.

      Every
      sunset paints a masterpiece across the sky.'
    background: {fileID: 6310229212490900833, guid: 2943505ae23764ae3a72a8e715f813f5, type: 3}
